    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Task Force for Improvement of Higher Education, appointed by Ms Zobaida Jalal, Federal Minister of Education, commenced the first in a series of dialogues on June 19, 2001, with the heads of degree granting public and private universities and colleges as well as heads of selected higher secondary schools and chairs of Examination Boards in Sindh. The Task Force Co-chaired by Dr. Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, President, Aga Khan University and Syed Babar Ali, Pro-Chancellor, LUMS, consists of the Federal Secretary of Education, the Chairman of the UGC, and Vice Chancellors of public universities and representatives of private universities.",
